  "description": "Fly on the road with ease! With its ultra-lightweight design and responsive construction, this 20-inch folder is a true speed champion. Equipped with DAHON custom-made tires and high-performance DELTECH cable, you can take it on any race, then fold it up just as fast.\n\nPowered by DAHON-V\n\nFeaturing DELTECH—key patents of DAHON-V technology—MU D9 offers superior frame rigidity for outstanding speed and safety. This powerful synergy enhances pedaling efficiency, making even uphill rides a breeze.\n\nFind Your Perfect Fit\n\nAdjust the handlebar's height and angle with ease, ensuring your ride feels just right every time.\n\nPrecision at Your Fingertips\n\nBuilt for precision and smooth shifting, this custom 9-speed rear derailleur by DAHON ensures seamless transitions across gears for an optimized ride.\n\nEfficient Pedal Power\n\nThis high-performance crank delivers smooth power transfer, making your cycling experience more enjoyable and effective.\n\nSafety First, Convenience Always\n\nThis intuitive safety lock allows for easy operation—just unlock the clasp to fold your bike, ensuring a secure and hassle-free experience.\n\nPowerful Climbing Ability\n\nEffortlessly tackle hills with ease, ensuring a smooth and enjoyable ride on all terrains.\n\nDolphin-Shaped Frame\n\nDesigned with sleek, flowing lines, this dolphin-shaped frame adds elegance and style to every ride.",
